    "chunk_text": "micelre mon\u00few\u00e6rnesse & \u00dea he \u00f0a se biscop to \u00fe\u00e6m cyninge cwom, \u00fea sealde he him stowe & biscopse\u00f0l in Lindesfarena Ond he se cyning his monungum ea\u00f0modlice & lustlice in eallum \u00feingum hyrsum w\u00e6s; & he & oft f\u00e6gre w\u00e6fersyne gelomp, \u00fea se biscop codcunde lare l\u00e6rde se \u00f0e Englisc fullice ne cu\u00f0e, Of \u00fe\u00e6re tide monige cwoman d\u00e6ghwamlice of Scotta lande on Breotone; & on \u00feam m\u00e6g\u00feum & \u00fea \u00fee sacerdhades w\u00e6ron, him fulwihte \u00feenedon. \u00dea w\u00e6ron eac cyricean timbrede on monegum stowum, & \u00feider gefeonde coman Angelcynnes & se cyning him gef & sealde \u00e6hte & land mynster to timbrianne; & Scottas l\u00e6rdon geonge & W\u00e6s eac munuc se ylca bysceop Aidan; w\u00e6s he sended of \u00feam ealande & of \u00feam mynstre \u00fee Hii \u00de\u00e6t mynster on eallum Nor\u00f0scottum & eallum Peohta mynstrum mycelre tide ealldordom & Ono fram \u00feyssum ealande & fram \u00feyssa munuca framscype to l\u00e6renne Cristes geleafan & he \u00fea se bisceop, betwih o\u00fere lare mannum to lyfigeanne, \u00fea f\u00e6gerestan bysene his gingrum & \u00fe\u00e6t swi\u00f0ust his lare gefultumade, \u00fe\u00e6t he o\u00f0re wisan ne lyfede nemne swa he l\u00e6rde. For\u00f0on he nowiht sohte ne ne lufade \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00feyses middangeardes w\u00e6ron; ac eall \u00fea woruldgod \u00fea Ferde he geond eall ge \u00feurh mynsterstowe ge \u00feurh folcst",
